     1009   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1010        b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     1011        b-calc AT ROW 1 COL 11
     1012        b-help AT ROW 1 COL 21
     1013        vardir AT ROW 2.5 COL 12 COLON-ALIGNED
