     1017            TITLE "Импорт внешних приходов Trade -> Trade House"
     1018            DEFAULT-BUTTON b-exit.
     1019   ASSIGN
     1020          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1021          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1022   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1023   DO:
     1024     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
     1025   END.
     1026   ON CHOOSE OF b-calc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1027   DO:
     1028     define buffer bf_temp-filelist     for temp-filelist .
     1029     Define Buffer Bf-obj_Clients       For Ub.Clients.
     1030     Define Buffer Bf_Clients           For Ub.Clients.
     1031     Define Buffer Bf_Trn-doc           For Ub.Trn-doc.
