     1437   RUN disable_UI.
     1438   PROCEDURE disable_UI :
     1439     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1440   END PROCEDURE.
     1441   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     1442     DISPLAY vardir
     1443         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1444     ENABLE b-exit b-calc b-help vardir
     1445         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1446     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     1447   END PROCEDURE.
